@k.words.ti.noun.1 k.words.sense word=Ti pos=noun n=1 gloss="a light strong grey lustrous corrosion-resistant metallic element used in strong lightweight alloys (as for airplane parts); the main sources are rutile and ilmenite" synonym=titanium synonym="atomic number 22" is_a="metallic element" core.source="wordnet 3.1"
